<mxCell id="o330" value="Excise Department 2022.accdb: the old Access database (19 tables)" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=24;fontColor=#1f2933;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="0" y="0" width="1400" height="36" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="o331" value="Read from the file with Access itself (tables, columns, saved queries, forms, reports). All real data in the Office table was cleared in this copy; Access has &lt;b&gt;no relationships defined&lt;/b&gt; between the user tables, so every link below is a combo-box lookup that stores the chosen text, not an id." style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=12;fontColor=#4b5563;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="0" y="42" width="1500" height="56" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="o332" value="&lt;b&gt;LOOKUP LISTS&lt;/b&gt; (ID + Field1, shown as combo boxes)" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=12;fontColor=#6b7280;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="0" y="154" width="400" height="24" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="o333" value="&lt;b&gt;LOGIN TABLES&lt;/b&gt;" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=12;fontColor=#6b7280;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1340" y="154" width="400" height="24" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="o334" value="&lt;b&gt;Lines&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#6aa84f&quot;&gt;- - - green dashed&lt;/font&gt; = combo box in Office reads its list from that table (found in the column's Row Source).&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#9aa0a6&quot;&gt;· · · grey dotted&lt;/font&gt; = same list, inferred from the column name (no Row Source stored)." style="rounded=1;arcSize=4;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=8;fontSize=11;fontColor=#4b5563;fillColor=#fafafa;strokeColor=#c9ccd1;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1340" y="626" width="330" height="120" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="o335" value="&lt;b&gt;What else is in the file&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;- 288 saved queries: 14 are the lookup lists (&quot;Table X Query&quot;); the rest are search and register queries over Office, filtered by values typed on forms (e.g. Forms![Search year officer]!Text8).&lt;br&gt;- About 100 forms (data entry, search, menus, logins) and 11 reports (CR Register variants).&lt;br&gt;- The 4 login tables each hold one row: ID + pass, stored as plain text.&lt;br&gt;- &lt;b&gt;Table staff&lt;/b&gt; is not used by any Office column.&lt;br&gt;- Office.&quot;Name of Accused&quot; points at a query named &quot;Table prale Query&quot; that does not exist, so that combo list is broken.&lt;br&gt;- Lookup data kept in this copy: Table offence (23 rows), Table year (5 rows)." style="rounded=1;arcSize=4;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=8;fontSize=11;fontColor=#4b5563;fillColor=#fafafa;strokeColor=#c9ccd1;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1340" y="761" width="330" height="300" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
</root></mxGraphModel></diagram></mxfile>